 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi! How are you doing these days?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.36,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_26"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Doing well, thank you.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.52,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Quick question. Is it okay to leave my phone charging overnight?",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.55,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Modern phones stop charging when they're full, so it's generally safe. Many also have an optimized charging setting that waits to finish until just before you wake up.",
   "est_sec": 8.78,
   "gap_before": 1.98,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Where do I find that?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.18,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "It's usually under battery in your settings. Look for something like optimized or adaptive charging.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.6,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Wait, what was the last part?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.73,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "kind": "wait_like",
   "phrasing": "waitlike_05",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Sure. It's usually under battery in your settings. Look for something like optimized or adaptive charging.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.69,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Found it, it was already on. Huh.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 1.09,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Nice, then you're already set. Just keep the phone out from under your pillow so it can cool down.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 0.56,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "smartphones.dlg3"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Ha, I definitely",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
